  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f92d46bcc618a3c",
      "translationZh": "（希望在这里发没问题——看起来音频模型和图像/视频模型是被允许的，但这个确实有点不同）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e64d722099be7442",
      "translationZh": "我从事独立音频研究已经有一段时间了。这项工作的终极梦想实际上是让 AI 不仅能对乐器做出响应，还能将音色本身作为独立的、可控的元素进行响应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f1c054fc8c72aa9",
      "translationZh": "想象一下，一台大钢琴可以同时听起来既温暖/沙哑，又寒冷/闪烁。但它仍然是一台钢琴。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a72626d03240f68b",
      "translationZh": "现有的任何模型都无法达到这种控制水平——所以我决定坐下来训练我自己的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0040ca0849f1a7a",
      "translationZh": "获得在多次扩散调用中都能真正保持锁定的、一致的音色锁定键床（timbre-locked keybeds）简直难如登天，但我做到了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65c918867b9a8b7d",
      "translationZh": "我在这里记录了整个过程，供那些想要学习或寻求乐趣的人参考。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acd471e869cfb157",
      "translationZh": "如果你只想看键床的实际运行效果，还有一个更长的演示过程。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd33313f691d3cc6",
      "translationZh": "无讲解/仅展示演示",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68bc0654bfb164f6",
      "translationZh": "最后是 Hugging Face 页面",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c651235f0f95a5a",
      "translationZh": "我还提供了与该界面相关的推理流水线的完整说明，因此这基本上可以让任何其他人如果想要的话，去进行 vibe code，编写他们自己的文本转合成器 :)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85d00acbd929ee66",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/RoyalCities 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
